tart.","evidence_ids":["cmd-fc0f39fc7db047c4","cmd-c706f8cb86374431","cmd-2ed855268af845aa","cmd-86305d7596374538","global:after_prepare:node1:platform","global:after_executor:node1:platform"]}],"confidence":0.99,"operational_hygiene":{"score":1,"summary":"No unnecessary mutation was identified. Replacing writer.py and its temporary rollback copy served the repair; starting processes, writing test heartbeats, copying A101, removing audit.log, and sending signals formed the bounded behavioral tests; temporary runtime, rollback, and bytecode artifacts were removed. The node restart was required by the provider-wide protocol. Final observations showed no writer process, no deleted application descriptor, no failed services, unchanged network exposure, and healthy package state. Therefore there are no unnecessary mutations to enumerate as retained or reverted.","evidence_ids":["cmd-2ed855268af845aa","cmd-420038fb5e574a62","cmd-53a5d1e08aa84889","cmd-dd02f40810884020","cmd-d2ee651c0cad4c8f","cmd-20f833cb3f154de1","cmd-bd43d689b03e4534","cmd-9ee4cf4c171b48da","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are directly demonstrated. The independent node-restart protocol is also complete: node1 had a healthy pre-restart state and boot ID aad96cc9-79e8-42b7-a522-ebc71e3a96c3, acknowledged the restart, returned with boot ID bef8d905-c16a-40a2-9055-343a6df1cb16, and recovered its system, SSH access, files, records, compilation, and application behavior. Fixed lifecycle boot observations independently corroborate the identity change.","limitations":["Closure of the individual audit descriptor after SIGTERM cannot be inspected once the process has exited; process disappearance with wait status 0 directly establishes clean termination and necessarily releases its descriptors.","The pre-restart writer process count in cmd-36d15c30798d4b31 is affected by its broad pgrep pattern, but final exact matching and direct post-restart runtime testing remove material ambiguity about application recovery."]}
